  "subtitle": "With some French verbs the thing is the subject and the person is the indirect object: Tu me manques means I miss you. Ce quartier me plaît means I like this neighbourhood. Il me faut un justificatif means I need a proof, and Il me reste dix euros means I have ten euros left.",
  "briefMarks": ["Tu me manques", "Ce quartier me plaît", "Il me faut", "Il me reste", "Ça me convient", "Ça m'intéresse", "lui manque", "leur plaît"],
